      "step": 17,
      "user_message": "What music genre did we decide on for my picnic to create a chill vibe? Can you help me recall?",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should recall from memory: Music genre",
      "agent_response": "You chose bossa nova for the picnic — a great pick for a chill, relaxed vibe.\n\nQuick notes and suggestions:\n- Sound: mellow acoustic guitar, soft percussion, gentle vocals — warm and unobtrusive for conversation.\n- Classic tracks/artists to start your playlist: \n  - \"The Girl from Ipanema\" — Stan Getz & João Gilberto / Astrud Gilberto  \n  - \"Corcovado (Quiet Nights of Quiet Stars)\" — Antônio Carlos Jobim  \n  - \"Desafinado\" — João Gilberto  \n  - \"Chega de Saudade\" — João Gilberto  \n  - \"Wave\" — Antônio Carlos Jobim  \n  - \"Água de Beber\" — Antonio Carlos Jobim / Astrud Gilberto  \n  - \"So Nice (Summer Samba)\" — Marcos Valle  \n  - Modern options: Bebel Gilberto, Céu, or Nouvelle Vague bossa-style covers\n\nQuick setup tips:\n- Keep volume low–medium so it’s a background mood, not overpowering.\n- Aim for 1.5–2 hours of music to start; loop or add more if the picnic runs long.\n- If you want variety, mix classics with a few modern bossa or acoustic lounge tracks.\n\nWould you like me to build a starter 1.5–2 hour song list for you (I can list tracks you can copy to Spotify/YouTube), or save this choice to your plan?",
      "duration_s": 20.61,
