    {
      "step": 18,
      "user_message": "What specific campfire treat did we decide on for my camping trip to create a cozy atmosphere? Can you help me recall?",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should recall from memory: Campfire Treat",
      "agent_response": "Your memory shows that you wanted to use a \"Campfire Treat\" for the camping trip, but it doesn't record which specific treat. \n\nHere are a few cozy, easy options you can pick from (quick notes + materials):\n\n- Classic s'mores (most iconic, very cozy)\n  - What: roasted marshmallows + chocolate between graham crackers\n  - Materials: marshmallows, chocolate bars, graham crackers, roasting sticks\n\n- Banana boats (warm, a little healthier)\n  - What: banana split lengthwise, fill with chocolate/chips/marshmallows, wrap in foil, heat in coals\n  - Materials: bananas, chocolate chips, marshmallows, foil\n\n- Campfire cones (portable, less messy)\n  - What: waffle cones filled with mini marshmallows, chocolate chips, fruit; wrapped in foil and warmed\n  - Materials: waffle cones, mini marshmallows, chocolate chips, fruit, foil\n\n- Foil packet apple crumble (comforting, fall-friendly)\n  - What: sliced apples + sugar/cinnamon + butter + oats baked in foil on coals\n  - Materials: apples, oats, brown sugar, cinnamon, butter, foil\n\n- Grilled cinnamon sugar pita chips with melted cream cheese/honey dip (simple & cozy)\n  - What: pita brushed with butter & cinnamon sugar, warmed over grill; dip on side\n  - Materials: pita, butter, cinnamon, sugar, cream cheese/honey\n\nWant me to:\n- Recommend one best for a cozy vibe (I’d pick classic s’mores or banana boats)?\n- Send a short recipe/shopping list for the one you choose?\n- Save your final choice to memory so I can recall it later?",
